IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-BIONIKA-SYNTH-OVERDRIVE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-MAX-SAMPLE-PCM16  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-SYNTH-PARAMS.
   05 D1-TRACK-IDX         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-BASE-FREQ-HZ      PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-GAIN-Q16          PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-ACOUSTIC-NORM.
   05 D2-HARMONIC-Q16      PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-RMS-NORM-Q16      PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-SHADOW-GAIN       PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R12.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 32767 TO D0-MAX-SAMPLE-PCM16.
    MOVE 1 TO D1-TRACK-IDX.
    MOVE 55 TO D1-BASE-FREQ-HZ.
    MOVE 55705 TO D1-GAIN-Q16.

    PERFORM STAGE-HARMONIC-OVERDRIVE.
    PERFORM STAGE-INTERLEAVED-RMSNORM.
    PERFORM EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D2-SHADOW-GAIN == D1-GAIN-Q16 AND D2-RMS-NORM-Q16 <= 65536
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 5 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-HARMONIC-OVERDRIVE.
    MOVE D1-GAIN-Q16 TO D2-SHADOW-GAIN.
    COMPUTE D2-HARMONIC-Q16 = D1-GAIN-Q16 - ((D1-GAIN-Q16 * D1-GAIN-Q16) / 196608).
    EXIT.

STAGE-INTERLEAVED-RMSNORM.
    COMPUTE D2-RMS-NORM-Q16 = (D2-HARMONIC-Q16 * 65536) / (D2-HARMONIC-Q16 + 8192).
    COMPUTE D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE = 875 + ((125 * D1-TRACK-IDX) / 7).
    EXIT.

EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = (((D2-HARMONIC-Q16 + D2-RMS-NORM-Q16 + 43605) * D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE) / 1000).
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
